"e": "Unfused: 4 ops × (200 MB read + 200 MB write) = 1,600 MB. Fused: 200 MB in + 200 MB out = 400 MB. For memory-bound ops, time ≈ bytes ÷ bandwidth, so this is close to a 4× speed-up for that chain."
